# ADR-0018: cast a real Instant through CastSpell's own third branch
# (castInstantOrSorcery). Two Swamps pay {1}{B} -- one for the black pip,
# one for the generic -- and Terror becomes an object on the stack (CR
# 405.2, 601.2i), with its own target (CR 601.2c) chosen before the cost is
# paid. resolvestack resolves it through destroyEffect, which moves the
# targeted creature to its owner's graveyard; ResolveStack's own
# post-resolution move (moveResolvedSpellToGraveyard, stack.go) then moves
# Terror itself off the Stack zone into its owner's graveyard, since
# destroyEffect never touches its own source card.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 B
tapformana human 3 B
queue paygeneric B
queue targets 4
castspell human 1
resolvestack
